  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "ses spr\u00e6c & Drihten him andwyrde. & Drihten eode uppon \u00f0\u00e6s muntes cn\u00e6p, & clypode Moyses to him, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ga ny\u00f0er & Syn \u00f0a s\u00e6cerdas gehalgode, \u00fee beforan Drihtne ga\u00f0, \u00f0\u00e6t ic hi ne slea. & Moyses cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Drihtne: Ne m\u00e6g \u00feis folc astigan on Sinai munt; \u00f0u hete settan gem\u00e6ro abutan Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Ga ny\u00f0er to \u00f0is folce & Aaron mid \u00f0e; ne cumon \u00f0a sacerdas neah Drihtne, \u00f0e Moyses eode ny\u00f0er to \u00f0am folce, & rehte hit eall him. & GOD spr\u00e6c \u00f0us: Ic eom Drihten \u00f0in God. Ne wyrc \u00f0u \u00f0e agrafene godas, Ne ne wur\u00f0a: ic wrece f\u00e6dera unrihtwisnesse on bearnum. & ic do mildheortnesse \u00f0am \u00f0e me lufia\u00f0 & mine bebodu healda\u00f0. Ne nemne \u00f0u Drihtnes naman on idel; ne bi\u00f0 he unscyldig, se \u00f0e his naman on idel nem\u00f0. Gehalga \u00feone rested\u00e6g. Wyrc six dagas ealle \u00f0ine weorc. Se seofo\u00f0a is Drihtnes rested\u00e6g, \u00f0ines Godes; ne wyrc \u00f0u nan weorc on \u00f0am d\u00e6ge, ne nan \u00f0\u00e6ra \u00f0e On six dagon God geworhte heofonan & eor\u00f0an & s\u00e6 & ealle \u00f0a \u00f0inc \u00fee on him synd, & reste \u00f0i Arwur\u00f0a f\u00e6der & modor. Ne sleh \u00f0u. Ne synga \u00f0u. Ne stel \u00f0u. Ne beo \u00f0u on leasre gewitnesse ne ongean \u00f0inne nextan. Ne wilna \u00f0u \u00f0",
